            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "RECALL",
              "instruction": "say gottā",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU RECALL: say *gottā*]"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 5,
          "type": "recall",
          "title": "Wrap-up Recall",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 3,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 3s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What does ಇನ್ನೊಂದು (innondu) mean? (\"another one\".) Which two words is it built from? (innū and ondu.)"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "KA-C71-say-again",
      "sequence": 2400,
      "title": "ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಸಲ ಹೇಳಿ (innondu sala hēḷi) — please say it once more",
      "headword": "ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಸಲ ಹೇಳಿ",
      "romanization": "innondu sala hēḷi",
      "gloss": "please say it once more",
      "script": "kannada",
      "modality": "voice",
      "derivedModality": "voice",
      "modalityReasons": [
        "no-visual-dependency"
      ],
      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:c7731cde9a542dfc",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Before the new one: how do you ask for another tea?"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಸಲ ಹೇಳಿ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಸಲ ಹೇಳಿ (innondu sala hēḷi) — \"please say it once more.\""
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸಲ (sala) is a time in the counting sense — one time, two times — so ಇನ್ನೊಂದು (innondu) ಸಲ is \"one more time\". The verb is the polite ಹೇಳಿ you met with the sentence about the way."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "This is the single most useful sentence a beginner owns, and until now this book had no way to build it. Everything else you can survive without; you cannot survive without asking somebody to repeat themselves."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Put ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು in front and it is as polite as it gets: ದಯವಿಟ್ಟು ಇನ್ನೊಂದು ಸಲ ಹೇಳಿ (innondu sala hēḷi). Said with a slight rise it is warm rather than demanding, and nobody in Karnataka will mind hearing it — a stranger trying the language is worth the second go."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The repair sentence. With it, every other sentence in this book gets a second chance."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 1s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "innondu sala hēḷi",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *innondu sala hēḷi*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "dayaviṭṭu innondu sala hēḷi",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: *dayaviṭṭu innondu sala hēḷi*]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
              "action": "SAY",
              "instruction": "somebody says something too fast — ask for it again",
              "spoken": true,
              "scored": false,
              "responseSeconds": 8,
              "source": "[YOU SAY: somebody says something too fast — ask for it again]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "prompt",
